@startuml
title Figure 9. Deployment Diagram - Moderated Learning Management System

actor "Administrator" as A
actor "Lecturer" as L
actor "Head of Department" as H
actor "Student" as S

node "School Computer\n(Windows / Linux / macOS)" as PC {
  artifact "lms\n(C++17 console executable)" as APP
  database "lms.db\n(SQLite database file)" as DB
  APP --> DB : in-process reads/writes\n(embedded SQLite)
}

A --> APP : console session
L --> APP : console session
H --> APP : console session
S --> APP : console session

note bottom of PC
  Single-machine, fully offline deployment. No server, network
  service, container or external dependency to configure. SQLite
  and the password hasher are compiled into the executable; the
  database is a single file to back up.
end note
@enduml
